consolidated annual revenue does not exceed EUR 2,000,000.

"Group" means you and all entities that directly or indirectly control you,
are controlled by you, or are under common control with you. "Control" means
ownership of more than 50% of voting rights or the power to direct management.
Revenue is assessed for the Group as a whole, eliminating intra-group revenue,
for its most recently completed financial year. A Group without a completed
financial year must use a reasonable, documented good-faith estimate of revenue
for its first financial year. Revenue in other currencies is converted using
the applicable year's average European Central Bank exchange rate, or a
documented reasonable equivalent if no such rate is available. Dividing an
organization into subsidiaries or other arrangements does not multiply the
revenue threshold.

